{"approach": "I read the constraint as a label whose main word begins with 'nu', and checked common words and phrases for lasting dispositions. Only a few real traits fit, so I give those and stop rather than invent words.",
 "items": [
  {"label": "nurturing", "gloss": "This means reliably caring for others and actively supporting their growth, comfort, and development over time.", "antonym": "neglectful", "kind": "trait", "ambiguity_flag": false, "probability": 0.5},
